Error [jet.UnlockedToolchainChannel]: Toolchain channel `a0.9` is pinned but not locked
 Why: An `--offline`/CI build won't resolve a channel — it needs the exact toolchain version recorded in `.jet/lock`, and none is present.
 Fix: Run `jet update jet` to resolve `a0.9` to an exact version and commit `.jet/lock`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1250
